{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A demo that will leave you wanting more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Mazer Laser demo, you'll find a fast-paced and challenging arcade game. Enjoy 10 minutes of gameplay where you can try out the rogue mode or the classic mode, with over 50 levels included in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAST AND CHALLENGING ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge, teleport, and move forward. Challenge yourself by dashing at the speed of light through all types of mazes in this Arcade game. Your precision and speed will be put to test.\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/extras/mazerlaserMedium-ezgif.com-optimize_1_.gif?t=1748356329\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIABOLICAL DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/extras/MazerLaserpiramid_12_fp_optimize_3_mb.gif?t=1748356329\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPEEDRUNNER, THIS IS YOUR PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against yourself and other players. Each level has its own leaderboard. Can you make it to the top score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/extras/mazerlaserspeedrun_compress.gif?t=1748356329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Over 50 handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Incremental difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Leaderboards for each level and mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Random elements and orientations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Roguelite/infinite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Improve your times on each level and compete against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Enhanced input response for better control feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Electronic music that adapts to the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Speed, lots of speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Have we mentioned that the game is made with a lot of love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Extremely fun.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FINISH DEMO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765760/4c1bc4f8e82047a098a49d124642fc2cd9815526.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765760?t=1748356329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/c027554ac6b9b47acf14c7a4f424b08077318ea8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748356329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/2df84f3bd148a99d1191dc1b70e26f8db867c428/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748356329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765760/2df84f3bd148a99d1191dc1b70e26f8db867c428/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748356329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A demo that will leave you wanting more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Mazer Laser demo, you'll find a fast-paced and challenging arcade game. Enjoy 10 minutes of gameplay where you can try out the rogue mode or the classic mode, with over 50 levels included in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FAST AND CHALLENGING ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge, teleport, and move forward. Challenge yourself by dashing at the speed of light through all types 